OL,3,GNEWSAWork to restore station lifts to
OL,4,Atake over a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to install lifts at the nearest
OL,7,Frailway station to Premier League club
OL,8,FAFC Bournemouth is expected to take
OL,9,Fjust over a year, South Western Railway
OL,10,F(SWR) has said.
OL,12,FThe lifts that once connected Pokesdown
OL,13,Fstation's entrance with the platforms
OL,14,Fbelow were mothballed in 1979, and
OL,15,Fcampaigners have spent the past 16
OL,16,Fyears calling for step-free access to
OL,17,Fbe restored.
OL,19,FEarlier this year, Bournemouth,
OL,20,FChristchurch and Poole (BCP) Council
OL,21,Fwithdrew more than #2m it had pledged
OL,22,Ftowards the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
