OL,3,GNEWSAWork to restore station lifts to
OL,4,Atake over a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut work on the #7.2m project - funded
OL,7,Fby SWR, the government and Network Rail
OL,8,F- is set to start at the beginning of
OL,9,FOctober and be completed in early 2028.
